<header class="site-header">
  <p class="eyebrow">Reference / Canonical axis</p>
  <h1>XOPQ</h1>
  <p>
    A thick-stroke transformation. XOPQ changes the thickness of thick-stroke
    components while preserving other aspects of the design where possible.
  </p>
</header>

<div class="intro-content axis-page">
  <section>
    <h2>Current content source</h2>
    <p>Amstelvar Avar2</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Expected behaviour</h2>
    <p>
      Thick strokes become thinner or thicker while other aspects of the design
      remain stable where possible.
    </p>
  </section>

