  <section>
    <h2>Dependencies and exceptions</h2>
    <p>
      In single-stem glyphs, an XTRA adjustment may be needed to preserve the
      intended proportion as XOPQ changes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Research notes</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The italic V at XOPQ minimum may be too thick.</li>
      <li>The italic E at XOPQ minimum may be too narrow.</li>
    </ul>
